Author-Name: Monfort, Ph.
Author-Workplace-Name: UNIVERSITE CATHOLIQUE DE LOUVAIN, Institut de Recherches Economiques et Sociales (IRES)
Title: Exchange rate pass-through in an unionized international oligopoly
Abstract: This paper is concerned with the relationship between exchange rate movements and the behavior of import prices in an unionized oligopoly with international trade. Specifically, the paper highlights the effects of labor market organization - reflected by union power and union-firm bargaining structures both in the foreign and domestic markets - on the degree of exchange rate pass-through.
Length: 23
Series: UCLouvain, LIDAM, IRES
Number: 1997006
Creation-Date: 1996-12-01
Handle: RePEc:ctl:louvir:1997006

