Author-Name: Laruelle, Annick
Author-Workplace-Name: UNIVERSITE CATHOLIQUE DE LOUVAIN, Institut de Recherches Economiques et Sociales (IRES)
Title: Implementing democracy in indirect voting processes: the Knesset case
Abstract: The aim of this paper is to determine the representation of parties in a Parliament that guarantees an equal representation of all the citizens. This problem is illustrated in the Israeli Knesset.
Classification-JEL: C71; D70
Keywords: Voting Power; Democracy
Length: 7
Series: UCLouvain, LIDAM, IRES
Number: 1997013
Creation-Date: 1997-08-01
File-URL: http://sites.uclouvain.be/econ/DP/IRES/9713.dvi
