Author-Name: Gautier, Axel
Author-Workplace-Name: UNIVERSITE CATHOLIQUE DE LOUVAIN, Institut de Recherches Economiques et Sociales (IRES)
Title: Regulation under Wealth Constraints
Abstract: This article studies the problem of regulating a monopolist with unknown marginal cost. The problem described differs from Baron and Myerson [1982] because we suppose that the regulator faces a cash-in-advance constraint. The introduction of such a constraint may lead to the collapse of the incentive system.
Classification-JEL: D82; H42; L51
Keywords: Regulation; asymmetric information; monopolist
