Author-Workplace-Name: UNIVERSITE CATHOLIQUE DE LOUVAIN, Center for Operations Research and Econometrics (CORE) and Institut de Recherches Economiques et Sociales(IRES)
Author-Name: Omar, LICANDRO
Author-Workplace-Name: EUI, European University Institute (Firenze-Italy)
Author-Name: Antonio, MINNITI
Author-Workplace-Name: UNIVERSITE CATHOLIQUE DE LOUVAIN, Institut de Recherches Economiques et Sociales (IRES) and Center for Operations Research and Econometrics (CORE), Belgium
Title: Adoption and diffusion of cost reducing innovations : Cournot competition in duopoly
Abstract: This note analyses the adoption and diffusion of innovations in a horizontally differentiated Cournot duopoly in which firms have to choose the dates for adopting a cost-reducing new technology like in Reinganum (1981a). We prove that product differentiation crucially matters in the diffusion pattern of the innovation and in the comparison between the adoption timing in the decentralized economy Vs the social optimum .
Classification-JEL: O31
Keywords: Adoption; diffusion; differentiated duopoly
